# BORGHERTZS_WILD_HANDS (jeuno 52): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job BST, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 BST: Beadeaux's Treasure Coffer opens to BeastJackcoat (the
# item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +131072 (bit 17); GarlaigeCitadel's to BeastHelm: +262144 (bit
# 18).
lists Beadeaux/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade GarlaigeCitadel/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=Beadeaux pos=-82.3,1.056,-140.1 job=BST lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsWildHands accepted
item BeadeauxCofferKey
item GarlaigeCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer BeadeauxCofferKey x1 # bit 17 unset: BeastJackcoat; [AF]ZilartCoffer 131072
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp -282.3,0,263.2 GarlaigeCitadel
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer GarlaigeCofferKey x1 # bit 18 unset: BeastHelm; [AF]ZilartCoffer 393216
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
